insert into public.playbook_records (slug, brand_slug, author, body, source, kind)
select 've-listing-check', 'vegans-explore', 'Logan', $pb$BUILD RECORD 2, 2026-11-01 (Logan). The listing check on the business dashboard, built in the ANSWER's order and proven live at each step. Full detail: CLAUDE.md in lesaruss/vegansexplore-com ("The listing check, in Sean's order", "The business dashboard", "Managed by us and Have us do it", "Dashboard versions").
1. D.HEALTH LIVE. ve-claims owner_dashboard returns health to every owner, member or not (free on claim), built by listingHealth from the listing, its ve_listing_health row and its latest monthly check-up (ve_audits source checkup): Google (open, profile complete; walk-in places only), Website (opens, https, menu online for food), Instagram (last post), Your Directory page (logo, photos, story, hours; member check-ins). A listing never checked gets its first website check started in the background (ve-listing-health one, cron secret). The check-up's flags show what we found and the fix (ve_audit_criteria.how), most important first, never the score. only: 'health' returns just the check. Proven: Sean on the Vegans Explore Podcast he owns (first check ran in 4 seconds and found its website, vegansexplore.com/vepodcast/, answering 404); admin on Happy Zoe Vegan Bakery (8 checks, 5 check-up flags); signed out refused. Sample: /business/sample?tab=brand&pd=audit, Corner Sprout Cafe with a made-up check-up.
2. HAVE US DO IT on every item not passed and every check-up flag (doItBtn in ve-partner-dashboard.js), opening VEManaged.open (loaded on first tap) with from fix and the fix id, so it lands in the Inbox as a Managed marketing request. The paid full audit ($49) and Secret Shopper ($149) show as See your full score beside Have us do all of it. The Audit view is no longer members only; Home has the score strip. The sample toasts what would happen. Checked in a browser at 1366 and 390 px, no script errors.
3. YOUR BUSINESS FIRST. ve-dashboard home returns each owned listing's id and logo; the Dashboard tab opens with Your business (#dash-biz, renderBusinessFirst): each listing with its score, Open your business dashboard and Your listing check. Checked in a browser as Sean at both widths.
DEPLOYED. ve-claims and ve-dashboard from commit f47decc (source sha256 matched). The proof session's one-time function ve-once-health-proof is the 410 stub.
NOT DONE. An owner who signs in still lands on /dashboard (now with their business first), not on the listing itself. The check-up runs on food and local places only, so a podcast or brand shows the listing check without check-up flags.
FOR SEAN. The Vegans Explore Podcast listing's website link is dead (404): put the right link on the listing.$pb$, 'text', 'decision'
where not exists (select 1 from public.playbook_records where slug = 've-listing-check' and body like 'BUILD RECORD 2, 2026-11-01%');
